{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30002_01_f",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:501c06e0562cb25a4ec3ea8949a28be610e2dc319ec950700948d258f2fa26e3",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77fa3fcdfe8b4e73815f78b4f80adb92d01aa2a1d114de23f3282c1351d98b5e",
      "text": "……原来如此，看来作家的道路很坎坷啊。\n那个啊，虽然我一个外人这么说不太合适。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47159548ae7c6b40fa517676e6941365f447e8ebff1133b3ab71b741abe6d21c",
      "text": "要放弃梦想，现在还太早了吧？\n我和硲先生可都是到了三十多岁才重新起步的哦？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c636cfd64cc86eebe2068a2a6c435a042b5b25ee285bca1a945ffeca2387c150",
      "text": "老师们能做到，是因为你们本来就很特别！\n我又没有……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e617e1ab07ead6db6763ea435fb4907d937808a7db1bbd312c4db9c7b600b9c9",
      "text": "呐，你当初是为什么\n想要成为writer的呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97476e472aff52222674828df381fca7b07cce76c07d5f992017e54a4c9ab6c5",
      "text": "那是因为……\n在写故事的时候，是最快乐的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6114ef02fe7b2197ee09483b8cb999ea219bf4414b91d55bfcd3cd1d722e891f",
      "text": "可是，现在却……只剩下痛苦。\n偏偏我又没办法彻底放弃梦想，所以格外……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da2eeca0c34f64a86bbcb690cdc5043f5652d21a5f6ae5ab5767816b98a37cb9",
      "text": "既然这样，那就再try一次看看吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0de079ccbf0afc6f391aa90a2e491bca1f332be0e398945a2877fadafb7be77d",
      "text": "舞田君和山下君说得对。\n朝着梦想，再去挑战一次吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23c1d633fb27cb4f030cddfb0a4fa76190c0651bc997650591280a993cfd4006",
      "text": "我们三人，无论何时都是你的后盾。\n这就是老师所拥有的特殊力量。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d22e255954dfa31ff5ac3de420f61d8a63bc66f63cf28b9c554bd89e5ad95945",
      "text": "老师……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48d03e86354463a2bbb2b85d2ee7dfacb8671f3343d6ef0a8291259ca0b1bcc5",
      "text": "……我，决定再试一次。\n在把这个剧本落实成形之前，我要撑下去！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef1d3ea99cbf51fe17ca9070ff61e14d65b72e7834dc0b8b4ee16ff593918886",
      "text": "成形……对了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d60df5f36f861e667e2e998f35579bb5bf0565135203610d70fedf21d68d034c",
      "text": "由我们来出演他写的script，你觉得怎么样？\n一定会成为非常棒的drama的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d110dbe77a523f680f18f98d7957319dfa936fbd5d21d6fb39bc5c9bdcf7c0e5",
      "text": "要、要是能那样的话\n我固然会很高兴，可是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f60d071a5158a22991785c835843b2dba70d490ad4b94fdd8298060218b13a0",
      "text": "我也觉得这是个好主意。\n首先来跟制作人商量一下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000149:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af57dbacdd25a804fd8ecb2891b22ff3b12f2e5ed145ee38bab734f676f7f830",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n突然打电话来，很抱歉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000151:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63d9665fc110d93990e8fef0d3d256ec2b9ca34d52bf87ac774ab64244880a85",
      "text": "实际上，我有个不情之请。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000153:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07714b7d9fa2de84d8dbd1d2ef66dd3f15cbfa1c58fcf86fe0a4502184c15558",
      "text": "我现在在从前的学生家里，\n那个学生写了一部电视剧剧本。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000155:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5bfbb2889894a025d264e2e275780f496b75e557278fac6ed14b5a803837449e",
      "text": "这部电视剧，\n能否由我们S.E.M来进行拍摄呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000157:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2140cea09447b8741e43ce5c7d54b18dc746d0b31bb66bf80f1cdc6d315931be",
      "text": "我知道这很突然，\n但我无论如何都想让他的作品化为现实。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000159:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64f92e64e28fc33d29846f95e006be57ac1d42b05cba3474a530af10e8e37152",
      "text": "如果能在我们的频道上播放这部电视剧，\n我想也能引发话题……你觉得如何？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000161:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf689362a644ae6d5970090bbeed9cd256d0e19636b2bea2e3295abf3947311e",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー酱！\n我也拜托你了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000163:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff2bc29cdde61662b6acf9e97f4f368efee14165478e6ec98b9cc183fb1de1d2",
      "text": "请务必去拍吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000166:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6eb81625a7e18f346b764af6c1ee877887f52c856dc7448a7c0053a1c35cf41",
      "text": "谢谢你。\n详细情况，容我日后再向你汇报。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000168:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a0ce367874169caff934c7ce0bb72608e1007a8bd7983c9e716fe1c87e3f68b",
      "text": "我这就去告诉我的学生，●●●●プロデューサー已经\n答应了这件事。那么，先挂了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
